|    The retry loop is correct, but the
|    timeout is not applied to the retry
|    itself.
|
|    ┌─────────┬────────┬─────────┐
|    │ attempt │ delay  │ outcome │
|    ├─────────┼────────┼─────────┤
|    │ 1       │ 250 ms │ retried │
|    ├─────────┼────────┼─────────┤
|    │ 2       │ 500 ms │ retried │
|    ├─────────┼────────┼─────────┤
|    │ 3       │ -      │ gave up │
|    └─────────┴────────┴─────────┘
|
